  "id": "vietnamese-lamb-chops",
  "name": "Vietnamese Lamb Chops",
  "subtitle": "Lime, garlic, and cilantro-marinated lamb",
  "description": "Lamb loin chops are marinated with garlic, chili, citrus, and soy, then roasted until tender and finished with fresh cilantro and citrus wedges.",
